{"articleNo":"2532","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2532&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010 하기방학 산업체 현장실습 모집공고(그린에너지)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.05.31","hit":"13074","attachments":[{"name":"현장실습 희망 업체리스트.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2532&attachNo=1716"},{"name":"산업체현장실습 신청서(센터용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2532&attachNo=1912"},{"name":"산업체현장실습 신청서(학점인정용).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2532&attachNo=1913"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 32pt\"><font size=\"6\">2010학년도 하기방학 </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 32pt\"><font size=\"6\">산업체 현장실습 모집 공고</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">그린에너지시스템인재양성센터</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">에서는 2010년도 하기방학 산업체 현장실습을 실시하오니 센터 소속 전공의 참여 학생 중 참가 희망 학생들은 신청하길 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. 신청대상 : <strong><u>센터 참여 학생</u></strong> 2학년 ~ 4학년 1학기까지 <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [3학기 등록자~7학기 등록자까지]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. 실습기간 : 2010.06.23(수)~2010.08.31(화)기간 동안 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">4주 이상</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">3. 1일 인정 실습시간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">법정근로시간</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 선발인원 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">60명</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">(선착순)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">5. 지급금액 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">300,000원/1인</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">6. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2010.06.01(화)~2010.06.08(화) 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">7. 신청서류(첨부파일 참조)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 현장실습 희망 업체리스트를 참고하여 작성하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #008000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">산업체현장실습 신청서(센터용)-필히</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">기간은 공백으로 제출(추후작성).</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 산업체현장실습 신청서(학점인정용)-선택</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">실습기관부분은 공백으로 제출.(최종업체선정 후 작성)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 하기방학 산업체현장실습 완료 후 다음 학기에 수강신청 가능(1학점).</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;(2010학년도 2학기 성적으로 등재 처리, 재학 중 3번까지만 수강신청 가능)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학점인정을 받고자하는 학생은 학점인정용 신청서도 함께 제출.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">미제출시 학점인정 절대 불가능!</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">8. 신청방법 : 센터로 방문 후 신청서 제출 및 신청명단 작성.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">9. 이수조건</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;① 신청서 제출 후 4주 동안 현장실습 무사히 완료.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 실습 완료 후 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">5일 이내</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">로 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">실습 일지, 결과보고서, 지원비 신청서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 작성하<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 여 제출.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;③ 업체에서 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">업체평가서</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"> 수령 후 제출.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">10. 제외대상 : 동일기간 타 사업으로 지원을 받은자(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">교육역량과 중복불가</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">) 및&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;이미 취업한 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">11. 문의사항 : 그린에너지시스템인재양성센터 행정실 공동실험실습관 401호</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Tel)054-478-7930</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2010. 05. 31.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 7pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼모음T'; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">그린에너지시스템인재양성센터</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
